Package: bcall
Type: Package
Title: B-Call Analysis for Legislative Voting Data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sergio", "Toro-Maureira", role = "aut"),
    person("Juan", "Reutter", role = "aut"),
    person("Lucas", "Valenzuela", role = "aut"),
    person("Daniel", "Alcatruz", email = "daniel.alcatruz@imfd.cl", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Macarena", "Valenzuela", role = "aut"),
    person("B-Call Team", role = "cph"))
Description: Implements the B-Call method of Toro-Maureira et al. (2025)
    <doi:10.3389/fpos.2025.1670089> for analyzing legislative voting data,
    integrating ideological position (d1) and political cohesion (d2) measurements.
    Provides two main approaches: automatic clustering of legislators or user-provided
    clustering. Users provide data as R data.frames with legislators as rows and votes
    as columns. Includes static and interactive visualization tools.
